@startuml
!theme plain
title Data Flow — RAG Retrieval & Summarization

actor User
participant "Web UI / CLI" as UI
participant "Ingest Agent" as Ingest
participant "DataBroker (store)" as DataBroker
participant "RAG Agent" as RAG
participant "Embeddings/Index" as Index
participant "LLM (Gemini)" as LLM
participant "Outputs (outputs/)" as Outputs

User -> UI : Trigger ingest / upload
UI -> Ingest : POST file + meta
Ingest -> DataBroker : POST /store (file)
DataBroker -> DataBroker : save /tmp/<id>
DataBroker -> UI : return artifact_id
UI -> RAG : trigger run (artifact_id, query)
RAG -> DataBroker : GET /artifact/<id>/download
DataBroker -> RAG : stream CSV
RAG -> RAG : parse rows -> docs
RAG -> Index : build embeddings (sentence-transformers)
Index -> RAG : index ready (FAISS or numpy)
RAG -> Index : query embedding
Index -> RAG : top-k ids
RAG -> LLM : prompt with retrieved items
LLM -> RAG : summary text
RAG -> Outputs : save summary, retrieval examples, plots
RAG -> UI : return results / status

note over Index,RAG
Fallbacks:
- If sentence-transformers missing -> TF-count vectors
- If faiss missing -> brute-force numpy L2 search
end note

@enduml
